Distinguishing features of the current work include:

* • Using density matrix states mapping ([7](https://ar5iv.labs.arxiv.org/html/2407.04406#S2.E7 "In II Formulation of the Problem ‣ Quantum Channel Learning")) as input. * • Go beyond unitary mapping ([3](https://ar5iv.labs.arxiv.org/html/2407.04406#S2.E3 "In II Formulation of the Problem ‣ Quantum Channel Learning")) to consider quantum channel mapping ([4](https://ar5iv.labs.arxiv.org/html/2407.04406#S2.E4 "In II Formulation of the Problem ‣ Quantum Channel Learning")).

